{"3417600": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Vaulted Valor", "steam_appid": 3417600, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vaulted Valor is a single-player first-person mystery set in a post-apocalyptic underground vault.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417600/extras/fdd4d9e9004fcdd9a89511998235d820.poster.avif?t=1787280325\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417600/extras/fdd4d9e9004fcdd9a89511998235d820.webm?t=1787280325\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417600/extras/fdd4d9e9004fcdd9a89511998235d820.mp4?t=1787280325\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're trapped inside Vault E-9, a supposed sanctuary built to outlast the Great Cataclysm. You entered by choice, but the walls that were meant to protect you now feel more like a cage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rumors of people vanishing and whispers of sabotage circulate through the dark corridors, all pointing to one man: the vault's elusive president, Sylas. Explore the labyrinthine sectors, navigate tense relationships with your fellow survivors, and dig into a web of hidden agendas. In this place, every conversation and choice matters. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The truth is waiting, but how deep are you willing to go?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417600/extras/d1573666b3618d1c4c9d60b9d004038c.poster.avif?t=1787280325\" width=1170 